cff-version: 1.2.0
title: MedCoder ICD-10-CM open data
message: If you use these files, please link to https://medcoder.ai and to this repository.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: MedCoder.ai
    website: https://medcoder.ai
license: CC0-1.0
url: https://medcoder.ai/updates
abstract: >-
  Machine-readable derivatives of the public-domain CMS/CDC ICD-10-CM release files: the
  FY2026-to-FY2027 change lists, every Excludes1 and Excludes2 note in the FY2027 tabular
  with parsed code references, and per-fiscal-year code counts from FY2016 to FY2027.
